OL,3,AWorld's youngest reigning traditional
OL,4,Amonarch dies aged 34
OL,5,
OL,6,FA traditional Ugandan ruler named as
OL,7,Fthe world's youngest monarch has died
OL,8,Faged 34, his prime minster announced.
OL,10,FOyo Nyimba Kabamba Iguru Rukidi IV
OL,11,Fbecame king of Tooro in western Uganda
OL,12,Fat just three years old in 1995 after
OL,13,Fthe death of his father.
OL,15,FThe Tooro kingdom did not disclose the
OL,16,Fcause of King Oyo's death, but a
OL,17,FUgandan government minister was quoted
OL,18,Fin local media saying that he had been
OL,19,Fcritically ill and was seeking
OL,20,Ftreatment in the US.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
