OL,3,AWorld's youngest reigning traditional
OL,4,Amonarch dies aged 34
OL,5,
OL,6,FThough Uganda is governed by an elected
OL,7,Fpresident and parliament, it has
OL,8,Fseveral traditional kingdoms which
OL,9,Fcontinue to have significant cultural
OL,10,Finfluence despite not having political
OL,11,Fpower.
